  "description": "LGBTQ+ Pride is a global movement and cultural expression celebrating lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender, queer, and other non-heteronormative identities. It is rooted in historical activism and is often marked by public demonstrations, parades, and festivals. The rainbow flag, visible in the image, is the international symbol of LGBTQ+ Pride, representing diversity and inclusion. The term 'gays' in the text refers to gay men, a subset of the broader LGBTQ+ community.",
